\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Thine for ever! God of love,
\par Hear us from Thy throne above;
\par Thine for ever may we be,
\par Here and in eternity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thine for ever! Lord of life,
\par Shield us through our earthly strife:
\par Thou the Life, the Truth, the Way,
\par Guide us to the realms of day.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thine for ever! O how blest
\par They who find in Thee their rest!
\par Saviour, Guardian, Heavenly Friend,
\par O defend us to the end!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thine for ever! Shephered keep
\par These Thy frail and trembling sheep;
\par Safe alone beneath Thy care,
\par Let us all Thy goodness share.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thine for ever! Thou our guide,
\par All our wants by Thee supplied,
\par All our sins by Thee forgiven,
\par Lead us, Lord, from earth to heaven. 
\par Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

